Hi Antje,

We have made major changes to all the converters in MSstatsPTM that I am hoping will fix this error. The changes will be on Bioconductor starting next week (the new Bioconductor release). For now you can install the package from GitHub directly, using the code below:

```
devtools::install_github("https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstatsPTM")
```

